window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>It all began with an offer too tempting to resist…</b></p> <p>One million dollars in exchange for a year of secrets, passion, and danger. Constantino, New York’s most sinister mafia boss, and his wife Laila promised me trips on private jets across the Italian coastline, life in luxurious skyrises that overlooked the city, and the intoxicating nights in their bed.</p> <p>The only problem?</p> <p>Jealous best friends, FBI break-ins, and falling in love were never part of the deal.</p> <p>Can I survive these dangerous games? Or will this year be my downfall?</p> <p><i>Mafia Toy is a standalone novel within the Syndicate of Sin series. Join us in this spicy FFM billionaire mafia romance.</i></p>"; 
